line	<str>If you are fast enough, you can attempt to kill the chompy bird that Rantz tried to hunt. Otherwise, place another toad in the clearing.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pluck the carcass and take the raw chompy.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Rantz.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back into the cave and talk to Fycie and Bugs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Obtain the ingredients that they've asked for. The image on this page shows their location.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Use the <col=800000>raw chompy</col> on the spit-roast north of Rantz (the fire outside of the cave).</col>
step	24	-	Quick guide step 24
line	<str>Talk to Rantz East-north-east of Feldip Hills (fairy ring AKS).</str>
line	
line	<str>Chop down at least 3 achey trees immediately south-west of Rantz.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a knife on the logs to make ogre arrow shafts.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use 100 feathers on the ogre arrow shafts.</str>
line	
line	<str>Obtain 4 wolf bones (south-west from Rantz).</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a chisel on the bones.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the wolfbone arrowtips on the flighted ogre arrows.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the ogre arrows on Rantz.</str>
line	
line	<str>Ask Rantz all possible questions.</str>
line	
line	<str>Enter the cave north of Rantz.</str>
line	
line	<str>Attempt to unlock the chest until it opens and search it to obtain ogre bellows.</str>
line	
line	<str>At the nearby swamp (south-west), look for swamp bubbles and click on them to fill up the ogre bellow.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the ogre bellows on a swamp toad to obtain a "bloated toad".</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Rantz.</str>
line	
line	<str>Drop a bloated toad where the arrow points.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Rantz again and wait for the chompy bird to appear.</str>
line	
line	<str>After Rantz fires his bow, talk to him to receive an ogre bow.</str>
line	
line	<str>If you are fast enough, you can attempt to kill the chompy bird that Rantz tried to hunt. Otherwise, place another toad in the clearing.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pluck the carcass and take the raw chompy.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Rantz.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back into the cave and talk to Fycie and Bugs.</str>
line	
line	<str>Obtain the ingredients that they've asked for. The image on this page shows their location.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the raw chompy on the spit-roast north of Rantz (the fire outside of the cave).</str>
line	
